                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1a72b204-3aa3-314f-8e48-cebe73e0816e",
                        "entry_id": "0b4205f9-31d1-3b36-bd13-4dc9607ae33e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мифол. сверхъестественное существо в японской мифологии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "159a9c6b-2e85-428e-8ffc-abc0bebc6d6a",
                                "sense_id": "1a72b204-3aa3-314f-8e48-cebe73e0816e",
                                "text": "Сегодня японцы называют героев своей народной демонологии двумя терминами: ёкай и юрэй. Первый, имеющий значение «призрак», или «привидение», на самом деле понимается более широко."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "459f6171-227f-425b-a51b-dfb160ffc7b1",
                                "sense_id": "1a72b204-3aa3-314f-8e48-cebe73e0816e",
                                "text": "Каппа – пожалуй, один из самых известных ёкаев. Антропоморфная лягушка с черепашьим панцирем, в котором, по легенде, таскает несметные сокровища."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7c58048-73bf-4b23-8582-a85f242fb5b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b4205f9-31d1-3b36-bd13-4dc9607ae33e",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a72b204-3aa3-314f-8e48-cebe73e0816e",
                        "target_lang_word": "yōkai",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "yōkai",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5801302e-0a44-3e6a-9ae8-b5011f69935a",
                                        "entry_id": "5afbc2bc-f49f-3f15-b8d6-2cb25ce77fe5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of yokai."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b9311c8-8056-497e-8d1a-77ed056ce67b",
                                                "sense_id": "5801302e-0a44-3e6a-9ae8-b5011f69935a",
                                                "text": "Even today, visitors to Japan can see just how interwoven the nation’s culture is with its reverence toward the supernatural or unexplainable. This ranges from whimsically animated spirit worlds on film to the eccentric monsters and ghosts that feature prominently in contemporary artwork, to the yōkai woven into the tales of post-modernist writers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcfd1373-7421-493e-94e4-965c17b6c93d",
                                                "sense_id": "5801302e-0a44-3e6a-9ae8-b5011f69935a",
                                                "text": "Japanese Twitter is alive with images of a duck-billed mermaid yōkai from Edo-era folklore with the supposed power to see off the coronavirus"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdd5fcf4-ff11-4cc0-8faa-c5d1447828e7",
                                                "sense_id": "5801302e-0a44-3e6a-9ae8-b5011f69935a",
                                                "text": "Ryōtora passed under a torii arch, leaning semi-drunkenly to one side and propping itself up on a nearby tree. It looked like the work of time and weather, not yōkai malice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8980b54-7d46-4409-8bd2-58e924372560",
                                                "sense_id": "5801302e-0a44-3e6a-9ae8-b5011f69935a",
                                                "text": "Nobody knows more about these yōkais than you. You have the police experience, and you took care of a giant one without any human casualties."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa9530bc-0856-45f6-8fe3-99d1b8c2fac0",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b4205f9-31d1-3b36-bd13-4dc9607ae33e",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a72b204-3aa3-314f-8e48-cebe73e0816e",
                        "target_lang_word": "yōkai",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90442dbc-874d-473c-bc39-78b9c7a0779b",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b4205f9-31d1-3b36-bd13-4dc9607ae33e",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a72b204-3aa3-314f-8e48-cebe73e0816e",
                        "target_lang_word": "妖怪",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "妖怪",
                                "target_lang_code": "zh",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a158356d-ff29-39ae-9e3b-2e24b3b5e1ff",
                                        "entry_id": "4b0792d4-6783-3892-9894-483421cb6058",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "超自然的存在；怪異而害人的精怪；植物或動物變化而成的精怪"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "常用在中國神話"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88cd5d07-b13d-4022-9d1a-18719ab005df",
                                                "sense_id": "a158356d-ff29-39ae-9e3b-2e24b3b5e1ff",
                                                "text": "久之，宮中數有妖怪，王以問遂，遂以為有大憂，宮室將空。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "395e0bfe-b586-4af1-855a-d3a7d5031c47",
                                                "sense_id": "a158356d-ff29-39ae-9e3b-2e24b3b5e1ff",
                                                "text": "久之，宫中数有妖怪，王以问遂，遂以为有大忧，宫室将空。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25a9a073-c23a-4bed-acc0-483f72454c8b",
                                                "sense_id": "a158356d-ff29-39ae-9e3b-2e24b3b5e1ff",
                                                "text": "師父，你面前這個女子，莫當做個好人。他是一個妖怪，要來騙你哩。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cafb3e0-e7d7-4af8-b8f6-e14d881d8a40",
                                                "sense_id": "a158356d-ff29-39ae-9e3b-2e24b3b5e1ff",
                                                "text": "师父，你面前这个女子，莫当做个好人。他是一个妖怪，要来骗你哩。"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d595658-e85d-4c57-80cb-286f702ff850",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b4205f9-31d1-3b36-bd13-4dc9607ae33e",
